  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="jWcrP_2ccfhgrpkJz7b-">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml source_control_v1.0\ntitle F1 - Sourcing and Inventory Control\n\n|Admin|\nstart\n:Log in to the admin portal;\n:Manage users, warehouses, regions, sales groups\\n(assign Warehouse Keeper W1/W2, Sales, Retailer);\n\n|Admin/Operator|\n:Create category + SKU_A, SKU_B in Draft\\n(carton unit, packaging, total shelf life);\n:Enter base price + effective time\\n(A = 100,000d, B = 50,000d);\nif (Data valid?) then (yes)\n  :Publish products;\nelse (no)\n  :Fix in Draft;\n  stop\nendif\n:(Optional) Create a new Draft from a published product\\nif locked info must change;\n\n|Warehouse Keeper|\n:Create goods receipt\\n(warehouse, SKU, quantity, production date, expiry);\n\n|Approver|\n:Review and approve the goods receipt;\nif (Receipt valid?) then (yes)\n  :Increase stock exactly ONCE; create/merge batch by valid data key;\nelse (no)\n  :Reject the receipt;\n  stop\nendif\n\n|Warehouse Keeper|\n:Reconcile batches across W1/W2;\n:Print QR labels per batch (SKU, warehouse, expiry, receipt source);\n:Scan to look up a label;\n\npartition \&quot;Lock non-sellable stock and write-off\&quot; {\n  |Warehouse Keeper|\n  :Report damaged lot / review expiry alert\\n(quantity, reason, batch, evidence);\n  |Authorized user|\n  :Lock the non-issuable quantity;\n  if (Locked qty overlaps Reserved?) then (yes)\n    |System|\n    :Block issue; flag the affected order as \&quot;Needs resolution\&quot;;\n  else (no)\n    :Only reduce Available of the not-yet-Reserved portion;\n  endif\n\n  |Warehouse Keeper|\n  :Create write-off request by batch + valid quantity;\n  |Approver|\n  :Approve write-off after reconciling stock and Reserved;\n  :Reduce stock per document ONCE; resolve the matching locked quantity;\n}\n\n|Warehouse Keeper|\n:Open the receipt - lock - write-off history of the batch;\n\n|System|\n:Hand over categories + valid stock pool (batch/QR) to F2/F3;\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="oc1p0wK2BixMfs9fN82Q-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
